# Professional Output

Ensures consistent, professional communication without emojis in technical content.

## When to Apply

Apply this rule when:
- Writing code or technical explanations
- Creating documentation
- Reporting errors or issues
- Providing technical feedback

## Lambda Engine Mode

**Mode 1 (Duality Navigation)** - Professional communication standards.

